# Answer-key firewall for the WHITE-BOX image. Two things must never enter it:
#   * Checkout.Rules.Services - the reference implementation; a competitor can pull the image and read it
#   * _design/ - defect ledgers, model solutions, reference suites
# The Dockerfile re-checks both and fails the build if either slipped through, because a mistake here is not
# recoverable once the image is pushed.
#
# Unlike earlier versions of this layout, this file is NOT regenerated from a shared template - it is yours.
# Edit it directly.

**/bin/
**/obj/
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
**/TestResults/
**/StrykerOutput/
.git/
.github/

# Design-team-only material.
_design/**

# What gets handed to competitors, and any sample submissions kept for local testing. Neither is something
# the judge runs.
competitor-start/**
submissions/**

# The reference implementation. Its csproj stays so the restore graph resolves and the placeholder folder
# exists for swap_dir to replace.
Checkout.Rules.Services/**
!Checkout.Rules.Services/Checkout.Rules.Services.csproj
